      "“Quiet mornings and warm coffee make the best pages.”",
      "“Not all those who wander are lost.” — J.R.R. Tolkien",
      "“Collect moments, not things.”",
      "“The rain had been falling since Tuesday, softening the ink on every letter I tried to send.”",
      "“If you find this folded inside the blue coat, please don't read it until the train leaves the station.”",
